{"tmdb":1268053,"tagline":"Pooh and Friends are out for blood and honey","synopsis":"Fifteen years after Pooh, Tigger, and Rabbit are captured and turned into attractions for the sinister Woozles Circus, orphaned teenager Momo Milne begins searching for her missing mother. Following a clue linking her mother’s disappearance to the circus, Momo and her best friend Billie take jobs inside the bizarre traveling show to uncover the truth.  Behind the bright lights and carnival magic, they discover a nightmare: the circus hides monstrous half-human creatures, violent secrets, and a trail of missing victims. As Pooh and the others struggle under cruel captivity, their bloodthirsty instincts begin to resurface, turning the carnival into a slaughterhouse.  Trapped inside a deadly world of twisted fairy tales and brutal horrors, Momo must unravel the connection between her mother and the circus before she and Billie become the next victims of the Woozles’ terrifying show.","directors":[{"name":"Scott Chambers","id":1482026}],"cast":[{"actor":"Josephine Blazier","role":"MoMo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eF5Lvww6wT8a4wdq7i9Ak4gW3Th.jpg","tmdb":2575733},{"actor":"George Montague","role":"Winnie the Pooh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zAg31yy46hUB2rjDcSHbWmbVSQi.jpg","tmdb":4833585},{"actor":"Leo Harris","role":"Oliver","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4bg57XX6Juv4VPgkFWnVkz5cW8f.jpg","tmdb":5960764},{"actor":"Roger L. Jackson","role":"Rabbit (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kDAoLRPVKgfTXRhDep0JNouhyAV.jpg","tmdb":51957},{"actor":"Jacob Marshfield","role":"Rabbit","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/UGHAL1yFxrd7KyyYNPM8NNR31b.jpg","tmdb":3234614},{"actor":"Zena Donnelly","role":"Billie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xto2Nc6HfonsGEZUsCuKj5N7zWn.jpg","tmdb":1847655},{"actor":"Lewis Santer","role":"Tigger","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/itfxF8FK4LasNtlwCAJv9a3T82D.jpg","tmdb":4429409},{"actor":"Richard Stanl